abstract: >-
  Core experimental infrastructure for studying behavioural repairability of
  LLM-generated finite state machines: JSON schemas, deterministic scoring and
  diagnostic projection, constrained patch application, controlled repair prompt
  templates, dry-run orchestration, tests, and documentation. Release v1.0.0
  does not include large-scale campaign data, local model outputs, or
  unpublished empirical results. Update repository URL and author metadata before
  public GitHub and Zenodo deposit.
